    <h2>Kids Cheeseburger Meal — Full Breakdown</h2>
  <p>Every element of the Kids Cheeseburger Meal, explained:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cheeseburger</strong> — A junior-sized DQ cheeseburger with beef, American cheese, ketchup, mustard, pickle, and onion. The same quality beef as the full-size version.</li>
    <li><strong>Fries or Applesauce</strong> — Choose crispy golden fries (~260 cal for kids size) or no-sugar-added applesauce (~50 cal). Applesauce is the lighter, healthier option.</li>
    <li><strong>Milk or Soft Drink</strong> — 1% Low-Fat Milk (110 cal, good calcium source) or a kid-sized Coca-Cola product.</li>
    <li><strong>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</strong> — Included with every Kids Meal at no extra charge. The same $2.39 Vanilla Cone served separately.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>For all DQ Kids Meal options and the complete menu, visit <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
