    <h2>Making the Healthiest Kids Meal Choice</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Choose <strong>Applesauce</strong> over Fries — saves approximately 210 calories and adds natural fruit</li>
      <li>Choose <strong>1% Milk</strong> over Soft Drink — 110 cal with calcium and protein, no added sugar</li>
      <li>The <strong>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</strong> is included in the $4.99 price — the same cone sold separately for $2.39</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>DQ Kids Meal Value Breakdown</h2>
    <p>Ordering the Kids Cheeseburger Meal components separately would cost: Cheeseburger ~$5.00 + Fries $2.49 + Milk $1.49 + Vanilla Cone $2.39 = approximately $11.37. At $4.99, the Kids Meal saves approximately $6.38 over ordering separately — making it one of the strongest value deals on the entire DQ menu.</p>

